# Aurelia, the Warleader: "Whenever Aurelia attacks for the first time each turn, untap all creatures you control. After
# this phase, there is an additional combat phase" (CR 500.8). Llanowar Elves is cast on turn 1 and tapped for mana on
# turn 3 to help cast Aurelia (Black Lotus RRR, Mox Pearl W, Plains W, Elves G). Bot2's Fanatical Firebrand attacked on turn 2 and
# is still tapped. Aurelia has haste and attacks: the Elves untap and the Fanatical Firebrand (not Bot1's) stays tapped. She attacks
# again in the additional combat phase, which does not trigger it a second time: the end of that combat is followed by the
# second main phase, 3 and 3, Bot2 on 14.

